silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'BindLawAlternatesConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, BindApplication_VetRecord_TypeStep: the bind application VetRecord_77_tree >>= TypeStep_fn; substitutes VetRecord_77 (the leaf of VetRecord_77_tree) with the output of TypeStep_fn(VetRecord_77) = T_Sigma(TypedRecord_77); the resulting tree adds a type-step layer to the existing tree structure; also, KleisliPipeline_IngestTypeValidateRender: the Kleisli composition ingest_fn >=> type_fn >=> validate_fn >=> render_fn; maps TartuClinicIntakeForm through the four publish stages to VetCarePlanPDF_77; the four-gate publish pipeline expressed as Kleisli composition." .
